    (uuid "3ada8464-db5e-526b-a1f6-33084d378e41"))
  (text "POWER-UP CLAMP NETWORK\nDiode anode = each MOSFET gate; cathode = POWER_GOOD.\nWhen the monitor is low, gates stay below NMOS turn-on even while LVC logic ramps.\n10k series resistors limit clamp current. Q1..Q5 retain gate pull-downs.\nR10 = 1k defeats FPGA configuration weak pull-ups on the arm request.\nGateware must initialize every drive/request low before explicitly asserting arm."
    (at 20.32 304.8 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "02b2c565-3188-5163-8e28-39ed525f2cfb"))
  (text "Checks required on hardware: OE2 remains high and Q1..Q5 gates remain low\nthrough slow ramps, configuration, failed configuration, reset and reconfiguration.\nMonitor has finite propagation delay; scope brownout response before target use."
    (at 20.32 355.6 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "84054786-7048-572d-b6f5-6e1cc02a1a49"))
